{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30410","headline":"洞庭寄所思 · 赵嘏","name":"洞庭寄所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"目断兰台空望归，锦衾香冷梦来稀。\n书中自报刀头约，天上三看破镜飞。\n孤浪谩疑红脸笑，轻云忽似舞罗衣。\n遥知不语坐相忆，寂寞洞房寒烛微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}